/cuda-programming-guide.pdf
__MACOSX/

# Vendored design reference for the image page restyle

# ---- Third-party engines we build and ship (contrib) vs read-only material ----
# contrib/ holds source we compile and run; references/ holds material we only read.
/contrib

# ---- Reference material, all third-party, consolidated under one directory ----
# Everything here is somebody else's code or a saved document kept for reference.
# ~8.5 GB, none of it ours, none of it tracked.
/references
